WEBVTT

00:10:28.999 --> 00:10:32.169
And everything worth doing
is worth doing half-assed.

00:10:32.211 --> 00:10:37.466
(Laughter and applause)

00:10:37.508 --> 00:10:40.636
You have to give yourself
permission to do a little.

00:10:41.387 --> 00:10:43.430
To do it with shortcuts.

00:10:43.472 --> 00:10:45.808
To do it while breaking all of the rules.

00:10:46.850 --> 00:10:49.645
And replace that inner voice that says,

00:10:49.687 --> 00:10:51.772
“I’m failing,”

00:10:51.772 --> 00:10:54.983
with one that says, "I'm having
a hard time right now.

00:10:56.235 --> 00:10:59.238
And people who are having a hard time
deserve compassion."